    "title": "ZBD: Earn Bitcoin Rewards",
    "description": "Download the ZBD App to earn real Bitcoin rewards for gaming. At ZBD, we believe Bitcoin is for everyone\u2014so jump into the world of Bitcoin rewards with us. Our app makes it fun, free, and easy to earn Bitcoin. \r\n\r\nPlay free games, take surveys, answer our daily poll questions, and more to get paid in real Bitcoin rewards. The ZBD App is also your secure wallet for safely storing or using your Bitcoin wherever you are online. \r\n\r\nHere\u2019s what you get:\r\n\r\n\u2726 Easy ways to earn real Bitcoin rewards: Play free games, take surveys, answer our Daily Poll questions, discover new apps, listen to podcasts and more to get paid in real Bitcoin rewards.\r\n\u2726 Your ZBD App is also a secure Bitcoin wallet: You can use it to safely store your Bitcoin rewards, as well as send and receive sats, get gift cards, and shop anywhere Bitcoin is accepted.\r\n\u2726 You can cash out instantly: When you\u2019ve stacked sats, cash out instantly with Cash App in the US, or other options depending on your location. No minimums required!\r\n\u2726 A chance to join ZBD Social: Our first-ever open social platform lets you earn real Bitcoin for content you\u2019ve created, and gives you the chance to pay others.\r\n\r\nWant to start getting paid real Bitcoin? Here\u2019s how it works:\r\n\r\n1. Download the app and create an account.\r\n2. Have fun! Play our featured games, watch videos, take our surveys, and more to earn real Bitcoin while gaming.\r\n3. Ready to use your Bitcoin? Cash out instantly with no minimums, get gift cards, or shop anywhere that takes Bitcoin.\r\n\r\nJoin our community\r\nDiscord: (https://discord.com/invite/zbdapp)\r\nX: (@ZBDapp)\r\nInstagram: (@ZBDapp).\r\n\r\n\r\nZebedee LLC \r\nAddress: 50 Harrison ST Suite 472, Hoboken, New Jersey, 07030 \r\nEIN 84-28678115 \r\nContact us: googleplaystore@zebedee.io\r\n*Transaction fees may be applied",
